  "overlays": [
   {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 0.79,
    "text": "減重，而且它是冰的，我跟你說，它是",
    "speaker": "spk_1"
   },
   {
    "start": 0.79,
    "end": 1.79,
    "text": "它是冰的，它是",
    "speaker": "spk_2"
   },
   {
    "start": 1.79,
    "end": 6.949,
    "text": "冰的，它有點像，對，",
    "speaker": "spk_1"
   },
   {
    "start": 7.07,
    "end": 9.979,
    "text": "我剛剛看它，它顏色也很像葷。",
    "speaker": "spk_2"
   },
   {
    "start": 11.81,
    "end": 12.229,
    "text": "他。",
    "speaker": "spk_1"
   },
   {
    "start": 14.6,
    "end": 17.648,
    "text": "他剛剛有那個咕嘟咕嘟的聲音。",
    "speaker": "spk_2"
   },
   {
    "start": 18.25,
    "end": 18.3,
    "text": "很",
    "speaker": "spk_2"
   },
   {
    "start": 19.209,
    "end": 20.889,
    "text": "可愛的，小心他會划走哦，",
    "speaker": "spk_1"
   },
   {
    "start": 21.58,
    "end": 23.25,
    "text": "剛那個鬥，讓大家",
    "speaker": "spk_2"
   },
   {
    "start": 24.29,
    "end": 26.83,
    "text": "很可愛，並沒有。",
    "speaker": "spk_1"
   },
   {
    "start": 27.689,
    "end": 36.989,
    "text": "不要再欺騙自己了好嗎？各位。那你把它拋拋3公尺。",
    "speaker": "spk_1"
   },
   {
    "start": 38.37,
    "end": 38.979,
    "text": "好嗎？",
    "speaker": "spk_0"
   },
   {
    "start": 41.169,
    "end": 43.3,
    "text": "有誒有誒，沒到。",
    "speaker": "spk_1"
   },
   {
    "start": 47.8,
    "end": 60.699,
    "text": "好，我們把它一下，對啊，很像布丁，很好嗯，我們來開動。",
    "speaker": "spk_2"
   }
  ]
 },
